Your classmate: Hi! I heard you want to learn how to code.
You: Yes, that’s right! {{1}}
Your classmate: I’m doing an online course on Saturday mornings. It’s free for students.
You: That sounds interesting. And {{2}}?
Your classmate: Two hours every week. We also get homework, but it’s quite easy.
You: Great. {{3}}
Your classmate: No, you don’t. The first lesson is for beginners, so you can start from zero.
You: Perfect! {{4}}
Your classmate: Of course! I’ll send you the link tonight.
You: Thanks. And {{5}}?
Your classmate: We use Python. Many people say it’s the easiest language to start with.
Your classmate: I’m sure you’ll enjoy it.
You: {{6}}
